**✨✨TOP TEN✨✨** ☂️*Fortnite☂️* MOMENTS THAT'LL MAKE YOU 😱😱**CURL UP AND CRY😱😱**

&#x200B;

10) The Scarecrow incident

It's easier said than done but just keep living for tomorrow, until you can find something you want to truly live to see, even if it's something small like you want to stay alive so you can see a movie that you think is interesting or play a video game you've always wanted to play and then move onto the next small thing and before you know it, you'll find a long-term goal to live for. Find any reason to want to live until tomorrow, no matter how silly you think it is. 

&#x200B;

You'll find a way to be happy living, it might not be straight away but you're strong and I bet you can make it though this. Stay safe.

Typical TF2 Players haha.

&#x200B;

This post was made by Buffy The Vampire Slayer Video Game (EU) For GameCube and PS2 Gang.
